WEBVTT

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.250
General Pino, the enemies number
around 25,000 soldiers.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.750
Our army of 42,000 soldiers have
the superior numbers, but...

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.420
We planned to surround the Torqyean army,

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.510
only to find that we are the ones surrounded by
the anti-Imperial alliance.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:06.040
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:26.250
Golden Eagle's Pursuit

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:45.890
All forces,

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.980
fire!

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:48.810
ARMY OF ESPADA

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:49.560
Fire!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:50.940
ARMY OF HUMO AND SEALLANT

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.280
General Pino!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.530
Our rafts!

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.870
Ignore the rafts!

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.160
Hold the formation.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:10.160
There are only 10,000 men surrounding us at best.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.130
They are no threat!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.000
The 7th Division led by Schmitt
will engage the Espadans.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.550
BALT-RHEIN EMPIRE 7TH DIVISION LEADER
ELMAR SCHMITT

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.090
The 8th Division led by Reus

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.300
shall engage Seallant's and Humo's armies.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:29.680
Barrett's 13th and 14th Division will engage El Toro.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.140
BALT-RHEIN EMPIRE 5TH DIVISION LEADER
VOLKER WINCHELMANN

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.860
Winckelmann will take the 5th Division,
and help support them.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.530
The remaining four divisions

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:40.700
will exterminate the Torqyean army as planned.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.160
All forces, attack!

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.890
The advance guard is mine!

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:17.690
Derecho, that's the toy-making bastard
who killed Halil Pasha!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.690
Yes, Izquierda.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.740
We will finish them before the main forces arrive.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:25.700
Make a path for Mahmut Pasha!

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.490
Fourteenth Division, Schnabel!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.500
Hurry with the ballistae!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:34.210
We need to buy time for the reinforcements to arrive!

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.000
Is that...?

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:43.970
Throw!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:50.720
Pull!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:55.980
Charge!

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:01.150
The toymaker is right in front of us!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.900
Go, go, go!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.320
Ready to fire!

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:05.910
-Ready to fire!
-Ready to fire!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.370
Fire!

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:20.590
The Torqyean style is perfect
for the turtling tactics of the Imperial army.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:24.130
Yeah, I've studied a lot of tactics,

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.300
but there's nothing that beats
taking the initiative!

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.350
The El Toro have put things in motion.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.730
Follow after them, men!

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.520
March forward while firing your arrows!

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:41.400
We shall go as well.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.530
Charge!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.750
They are trying to escape our encirclement.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:58.540
All troops, sprint!

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.050
Tighten the noose!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.920
We cannot let the Torqyean army escape.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:07.840
Crush them!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.020
If it wasn't for them,

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.980
we could help with encircling the Torqyeans.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:21.980
Espada will soon find out their tiny nation
is no match for us.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.480
Draw your swords!

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:27.110
Charge!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.950
-Yeah, that's not going to reach.
-Fall back and regroup!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:39.080
We're far past the age of a single sword
determining the battle.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:43.210
March forward! We'll crush the Espada Army
here and now.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.000
Espada has started to withdraw.

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:47.130
Okay, it's time we fall back too!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.670
Charge after them!

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.640
The combined armies of Humo and Seallant
are nothing to fear!

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.470
Maintain the lines.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.140
It is time for our revenge!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.600
The Imperials are faster than you'd think.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.490
What?

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.660
It's a dry moat!

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.200
A moat?

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:14.620
Impossible. When did they have the time?

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.500
Humo is a mining town after all!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.500
We only need a night for a job like this!

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:30.260
We are the ones who chose this site for battle.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:34.350
And we have come fully prepared.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:38.520
Your square formation is only good on flat ground.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:40.480
In a situation like this,

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.270
the length of your weapon no longer matters.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.690
Charge!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.280
General Pino.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.870
The 7th and 8th Divisions have both...

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:01.500
-Is that?
-The 13th Division has...

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:14.010
Mahmut! We took care of the toymaker!

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:20.390
Mahmut Pasha, there's an opening in the encirclement!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.850
Let's go!

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:24.560
Tughril Ascheri! Follow me!

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:27.440
Eleventh Division, move to our right flanks!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.860
Charge up the gut of our enemy!

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:33.610
The 11th Division is making an emergency adjustment!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.990
They are heading to fill the gaps
left by the 13th and 14th Divisions.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.290
If they do that,

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.330
our encirclement will crumble further

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.160
and create more holes.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.960
This is all going to Mahmut Pasha's plan!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:47.920
The enemy's flanks are exposed!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.380
All right, Kurt Ascheri! Follow me!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:52.970
Commander Barrett!

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.260
Oh, no!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.560
Go, go, Mahmut!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:10.360
Commander Barrett, please save yourself!

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.900
Commander Barrett!

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.360
What are you doing?

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.040
Commander Winckelmann.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:30.710
The 13th and 14th Divisions have been lost.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.170
Our encirclement was broken,

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.550
and our reinforcements were too late.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.640
Schnabel! The enemy is charging!

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.850
They are ignoring us?

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.280
What is your read

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.150
on their movement, Madam Tactician?

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.780
Their objectives

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.790
are our 7th and 8th Divisions
stopped by their moat.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.080
At this rate,

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.460
both armies will be pinched.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:12.340
Continue to block the arrows with your shields,
and march forward!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.840
Commander Reus!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.760
Torqyean Army on our right flanks!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.260
All forces, charge!

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:21.640
Fall back! Reestablish our formation!

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.100
Commander Schmitt!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.520
The equestrian tribe

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.520
have begun their hunt.

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:38.320
That is the son of Halil.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.500
Take up arms!

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:58.550
We are the glorious 7th Division
of the Imperial Army!

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.010
We will never...

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:03.010
We will never kneel before Torqye!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.790
Will our army

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.000
fall to this disorderly mob?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:38.340
We have been devastated. Any more and...

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:42.220
-Gather the survivors and fall back.
-Yes, sir.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:46.640
-I shall take responsibility for our defeat.
-Commander Reus!

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:49.680
Allow me to stop them

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.940
from bringing any further embarrassment to myself.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.940
Commander Reus!

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.070
How commendable!

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:03.160
I accept your challenge!

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:07.080
Witness the dignity

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.410
of an Imperial soldier!

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:23.130
The 7th and 8th Divisions have both been eliminated.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:27.050
Commander Schmitt, Commander Reus has also been
killed in action.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.850
And Commander Barrett has withdrawn from the battle.

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.680
Withdrawn? Did he run?

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.810
That is good he did.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:39.650
We cannot afford to lose the key to Minister Louis'
military engineer corps.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:46.280
We may be able to secure a route to the northeast
towards Espada,

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.200
but we'll be playing into the enemy's hand.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.950
Do you think it is a trap?

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.160
We cannot just walk into their trap!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.170
The entirety of Espada's forces

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.300
have been deployed on this battlefield.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:02.550
We will capture their home base
while their defenses are weak.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:05.720
I doubt that they've only left women
and children behind.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.470
Even if they had hired mercenaries to guard their city,

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:12.270
I would guess 1,000 men
would be the limit they could afford.

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.230
General Pino.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.440
Madam Tactician.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.690
Will you continue with us?

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.440
Of course.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:24.320
Because we have not lost yet.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.570
This is an announcement to all troops!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:30.280
We are withdrawing from this battle!

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:33.250
Our new objective is to the northeast!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.710
We will capture Espada!

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.290
Commander Winckelmann!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.050
We have just been issued orders to withdraw!

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.550
I see. Good.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.720
As one would expect of General Pino.
He is a quick decision-maker.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.300
Now...

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.060
Hoist the 5th Division's flag high!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:09.030
Our division will take down the El Toro
and the Torqyean cavalry on our own!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.240
We will hold the enemy here

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.910
until the other divisions have withdrawn!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:20.420
Get ready!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.390
Brace yourselves!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.360
He's not here.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.650
We've searched every room.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.860
CHAMBER IN CHIELO

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:52.570
Now where could they have hidden
Director Carbajal?

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.330
Five signals went up at the same time.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:04.130
As we'd expect from the Padrone,
a complete victory.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:07.460
I guess you guys can still see signals at night.

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.630
Only when there is a full moon.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.890
Our eyes are no match for a nomad's.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.850
We need to find the director.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:23.480
Our hunt is not over yet.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.070
We will commence our pursuit.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.120
Torqye is claiming victory?

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.580
We cannot let it end like this.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.210
We will get a chance to retaliate.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.420
BALT-RHEIN EMPIRE 11TH DIVISION LEADER
CORNELIA NOHL

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:47.500
I don't know about that.
I just hope we don't find ourselves

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:48.710
BALT-RHEIN EMPIRE 10TH DIVISION LEADER
DANIEL BIEGER

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.590
marching to Fondo following that tactician's advice.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.850
-You speak out of line.
-Do I?

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.510
BALT-RHEIN EMPIRE 9TH DIVISION LEADER
CLAUS ALTDORFER

00:15:56.680 --> 00:16:00.350
Do you not feel that Madam Tactician's strategies
have only backfired this time?

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.650
You're being quiet.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:15.200
This is all a result of my miscalculation.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.910
-From this point--
-It's ironic.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:22.710
By defeating Halil Pasha who once
triumphed over the Empire,

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:25.580
a new Pasha rose to prominence.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:29.460
A defeat will sometimes strengthen an enemy.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:32.930
We simply had forgotten this fact.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.680
That is what led to our defeat here.

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:44.190
Early Morning
June 29th, Torqyean Calendar Year 76

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.020
Hold, men!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:53.450
The enemy ranks have been stretched
by the narrow pass,

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.950
just as Lady Kokoschka planned.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:17:01.500
Hassler and Siebel's units will try
to ambush the enemy officers.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.960
We will not falter here!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.500
Hassler?

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.090
Siebel...

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.550
I see.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.810
They saw through our plan.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:27.980
In that case...

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.360
Draw your swords!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.940
Charge!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.400
Take down as many enemies with you as you can!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:43.870
The plan was to head to Espada after a brief engagement.

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.420
So why are we taking this detour?

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.960
Heading to Espada is exactly what Torqye
wants us to do.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.840
They would have definitely set a trap
somewhere along the shortest route.

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:55.220
That is probably why.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:58.970
Do you think Commander Kirchherr was able to hold
back the enemy?

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.140
No.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:03.520
The cloud of dust is getting closer.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.230
Lady Kokoschka's plan

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:08.310
has likely failed.

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:10.810
Hang in there, Lucas.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:14.070
You're looking a lot better than before.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.240
Conrad.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.530
What is it?

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:22.910
Why are they following us?

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:28.170
We were supposed to either kill or sell
every last of the Campanan.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.050
There aren't any Campanans.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.630
Only us soldiers.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.380
We're like

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:39.180
a group of bandits and outlaws.

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:43.140
Because instead of making more food for ourselves,

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:46.140
we choose to take from other countries.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.480
But we don't have a choice, do we?

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:52.150
That's the only way we can eat.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.320
And in exchange,

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:58.650
we worked hard to become strong.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:03.580
If they don't like having everything taken from them,

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:07.370
they just need to get strong enough
to protect themselves!

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.500
We didn't do anything wrong!

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:10.790
Lucas!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.590
Let's rest a bit. Okay?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:14.960
Come on.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.840
Are they the local peasants?

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.760
How dare you!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.060
Ignore them!

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:28.770
Those who stop and break rank
will be the first to be killed!

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:32.020
Keep marching forward if you don't want to die!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.480
It makes you want to cry.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.610
Even if we make it to Espada,

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:40.280
there's no guarantee we'll be able to make it out
of Fondo.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.540
We may be at war, but I still pity them.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:56.670
I doubt we have a pleasant death in store for us.

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:00.220
I have made my peace with it.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.350
ESPADA
IN FRONT OF CASTLE'S GATE

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:08.270
Charge at my signal!
The castle defenses are weak!

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.770
Don't let the pursuing Torqyean army interfere!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.690
We will stop them here!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:21.450
The Lince have been put in charge of defending this city.

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:24.320
We are quite strong, I'll have you know.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:26.410
LINCE LEADER
BRIGIDA GRIMALDI

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:28.080
As predicted,

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:31.460
they are the band of mercenaries hired by Espada.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.000
Take a look at this!

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:37.960
We were hired by the Cuore Alliance!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:41.590
Moving against Espada

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:45.590
means making enemies of not only
the anti-Imperial Alliance,

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.930
but the 34 nations in the Cuore Alliance as well!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:55.520
So goods and supplies weren't the only things
being sent from the Cuore to Espada.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.270
They've come.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.110
There is no escape.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:09.280
If you surrender, we will spare you your lives.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.590
General Pino!

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:22.760
The Torqyean Forces only number 13,000.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.010
With only an additional 1,000 men from Lince,

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.090
our force of 15,000 men

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.220
has sufficient prospects for victory.

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:36.440
General Pino!

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:41.650
The Lince are mercenaries from the Cuore!
They are soft and--

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:45.610
The Empire's history is a history of aggression.

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.280
In order to carry on that history,

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.540
the Empire must be a true superpower.

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:55.750
Hoist your flags!

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.380
As planned, the 9th Division will take the city,

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:06.760
while the 10th and 11th Divisions will hold off
the Torqyean army.

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:09.800
We will take down Espada,

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:12.560
and mark the beginning of our counterattack!

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:50.610
Where could the director be?

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:53.070
Chielo needs you.

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:56.910
The person with the key to heaven
who can guide the people.

00:23:57.660 --> 00:23:59.870
Next time, "The End of Paradise."

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:01.580
Please be alive.
